[[1577,615,"Mr Lawrence sustained significant unexplained injuries whilst he was a resident at Eastcroft Nursing Home","unexplained injuries to resident",""],[1578,615,"Nursing Home records were deficient in their recording of key events following his unwitnessed fall on 21 December 2022","deficient record keeping",""],[1579,615,"There was a delay in seeking medical advice following the unwitnessed fall on 21 December 2022","delayed medical advice",""],[1580,615,"The Nursing Home Manager providing conflicting evidence about efforts to obtain medical advice and did not accept that the acute fractures leading to Mr [name redacted] death occurred whilst he was at the nursing home","conflicting evidence on medical advice",""],[1581,615,"In view of all of the above, the Coroner is concerned that there is an ongoing risk to current residents","ongoing risk to residents",""]]